. cap program drop ereturnpost

. program define ereturnpost, eclass
  1.   ereturn post `*'
  2.   ereturn local cmd ereturnpost
  3. end

. 
. * given set of estimates, variances, and additional weights, return mean, variance of a Bayesian-update-of-normals-type average assuming no increase in information
. cap mata mata drop WeightedModelAverage()

. mata
------------------------------------------------- mata (type end to exit) -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
: real colvector WeightedModelAverage(real colvector μs, real colvector σ²s, | real colvector λs) {
>   wts = (length(λs)? λs/sum(λs) : 1:/length(μs)) :/ σ²s  // weights are products of precision and estimate-specific weights normalized to sum to 1
>   return (mean(μs,wts) \ 1/sum(wts))
> }

: end
